    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d7">

                <pb facs="0017" n="8" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg8"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00112 European War 1939/1641</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Assistant Secretary
                        of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grady</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-01-20">January 20, 1940</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The British Ambassador called at my request and gave me the attached
                        memorandum<anchor n="12" xml:id="d7-f1"/> of his oral statement to me with
                    regard to the working of the navicert system. I told him that we would study his
                    memorandum and get in touch with him later.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
